{"seq":3,"slug":"other-peft-methods","title":"其他参数高效方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/other-peft-methods","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"其他参数高效方法\">其他参数高效方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>参数高效微调（Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning, PEFT）不仅限于 LoRA。研究社区提出了多种方法，从不同角度解决&quot;如何用最少的参数更新获得最大的适配效果&quot;。这些方法在可训练参数量、实现复杂度、适配能力和推理开销之间做出不同的权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[PEFT 方法] --&gt; B[适配器方法]&#10;    A --&gt; C[提示方法]&#10;    A --&gt; D[低秩方法]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Adapter Tuning]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Prefix Tuning]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Prompt Tuning]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[P-Tuning v2]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[LoRA]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[AdaLoRA]\">graph TB\n    A[PEFT 方法] --&gt; B[适配器方法]\n    A --&gt; C[提示方法]\n    A --&gt; D[低秩方法]\n    B --&gt; B1[Adapter Tuning]\n    B --&gt; B2[Prefix Tuning]\n    C --&gt; C1[Prompt Tuning]\n    C --&gt; C2[P-Tuning v2]\n    D --&gt; D1[LoRA]\n    D --&gt; D2[AdaLoRA]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>可训练参数</th>\n<th>推理开销</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>0.1-1%</td>\n<td>可合并消除</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adapter Tuning</td>\n<td>1-5%</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefix Tuning</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>占用上下文长度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt Tuning</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01%</td>\n<td>占用上下文长度</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P-Tuning v2</td>\n<td>0.1-3%</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IA3</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01%</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"adapter-tuning\">Adapter Tuning</h2><p>Adapter Tuning 在 Transformer 的每一层中插入小型的瓶颈网络（bottleneck module）。这些适配器由下投影、非线性激活和上投影组成，通过残差连接与原始层融合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM&#10;from peft import get_peft_model, AdaLoraConfig, TaskType&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;adalora_config = AdaLoraConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    r=16,&#10;    lora_alpha=32,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;q_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;],&#10;    init_r=12,&#10;    target_r=8,&#10;    beta1=0.85,&#10;    beta2=0.85,&#10;    tinit=200,&#10;    tfinal=1000,&#10;    deltaT=10,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = get_peft_model(model, adalora_config)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model, AdaLoraConfig, TaskType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adalora_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AdaLoraConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lora_alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    init_r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    beta1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    beta2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tinit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tfinal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deltaT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, adalora_config)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Adapter 的核心设计是瓶颈结构——先将维度从 d 降到 r（通常 r=64-256），经过非线性后再升回 d 维。残差连接确保了当适配器输出接近零时，模型行为退化为原始预训练模型。这种设计比 LoRA 的参数量大但灵活性更强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"prefix-tuning-与-prompt-tuning\">Prefix Tuning 与 Prompt Tuning</h2><p>Prefix Tuning 在每一层的 Key-Value 对前面添加可学习的&quot;虚拟前缀&quot;。这些前缀不对应任何实际的文本 Token，而是直接在注意力空间中引导模型行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import PrefixTuningConfig, PromptTuningConfig, PromptTuningInit, get_peft_model&#10;&#10;prefix_config = PrefixTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=&quot;CAUSAL_LM&quot;,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=20,&#10;    prefix_projection=True,&#10;    encoder_hidden_size=256,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prompt_config = PromptTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=&quot;CAUSAL_LM&quot;,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=8,&#10;    prompt_tuning_init=PromptTuningInit.TEXT,&#10;    prompt_tuning_init_text=&quot;将以下文本分类为正面或负面情感：&quot;,&#10;    tokenizer_name_or_path=&quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prefix_model = get_peft_model(model, prefix_config)&#10;prefix_model.print_trainable_parameters()&#10;&#10;prompt_model = get_peft_model(model, prompt_config)&#10;prompt_model.print_trainable_parameters()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig, PromptTuningConfig, PromptTuningInit, get_peft_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CAUSAL_LM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prefix_projection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encoder_hidden_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PromptTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CAUSAL_LM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt_tuning_init</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PromptTuningInit.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt_tuning_init_text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"将以下文本分类为正面或负面情感：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tokenizer_name_or_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, prefix_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, prompt_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Prefix Tuning</th>\n<th>Prompt Tuning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>插入位置</td>\n<td>每一层 KV</td>\n<td>仅输入层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟 Token 数</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>5-20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可训练参数</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>极少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型规模依赖</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（大模型效果更好）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Prompt Tuning 的有趣之处在于，随着模型规模增大，软提示（soft prompt）的效果逐渐接近全量微调。在 10B+ 参数的模型上，仅 8 个虚拟 Token 就能达到不错的适配效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ia3-与-bitfit\">IA3 与 BitFit</h2><p>IA3（Infused Adapter by Inhibiting and Amplifying Inner Activations）是参数量最少的 PEFT 方法之一，它只学习三组缩放向量来调节 Key、Value 和 FFN 的激活值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import IA3Config, get_peft_model&#10;&#10;ia3_config = IA3Config(&#10;    task_type=&quot;CAUSAL_LM&quot;,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;k_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;, &quot;down_proj&quot;],&#10;    feedforward_modules=[&quot;down_proj&quot;],&#10;)&#10;&#10;ia3_model = get_peft_model(model, ia3_config)&#10;ia3_model.print_trainable_parameters()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IA3Config, get_peft_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ia3_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IA3Config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CAUSAL_LM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"k_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"down_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    feedforward_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"down_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ia3_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, ia3_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ia3_model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BitFit 更为极端——它只微调模型中的偏置项（bias terms），可训练参数仅占总参数的 0.04%。尽管如此简单，BitFit 在某些分类任务上仍能达到全量微调 80-90% 的效果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>参数量占比</th>\n<th>适合任务</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IA3</td>\n<td>~0.01%</td>\n<td>分类、NLI</td>\n<td>缩放激活值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BitFit</td>\n<td>~0.04%</td>\n<td>分类</td>\n<td>仅调偏置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(IA)³</td>\n<td>~0.01%</td>\n<td>Few-shot 适配</td>\n<td>元学习缩放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"方法选择指南\">方法选择指南</h2><p>不同场景下的最佳 PEFT 方法选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PEFTRecommendation {&#10;  scenario: string;&#10;  primaryMethod: string;&#10;  alternativeMethod: string;&#10;  reasoning: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const recommendations: PEFTRecommendation[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;通用领域适配（充足显存）&#39;,&#10;    primaryMethod: &#39;LoRA (r=32)&#39;,&#10;    alternativeMethod: &#39;Adapter Tuning&#39;,&#10;    reasoning: &#39;LoRA 效果好、合并后无推理开销&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;显存极度受限&#39;,&#10;    primaryMethod: &#39;QLoRA (r=16)&#39;,&#10;    alternativeMethod: &#39;IA3&#39;,&#10;    reasoning: &#39;QLoRA 降低硬件门槛，IA3 参数更少&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;多任务/多租户&#39;,&#10;    primaryMethod: &#39;LoRA + 适配器切换&#39;,&#10;    alternativeMethod: &#39;Prefix Tuning&#39;,&#10;    reasoning: &#39;每个任务独立的小适配器，切换成本低&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;快速原型验证&#39;,&#10;    primaryMethod: &#39;Prompt Tuning&#39;,&#10;    alternativeMethod: &#39;IA3&#39;,&#10;    reasoning: &#39;训练最快，参数最少，适合验证思路&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PEFTRecommendation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scenario</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primaryMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alternativeMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reasoning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recommendations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PEFTRecommendation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scenario: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'通用领域适配（充足显存）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    primaryMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LoRA (r=32)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alternativeMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Adapter Tuning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reasoning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LoRA 效果好、合并后无推理开销'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scenario: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'显存极度受限'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    primaryMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'QLoRA (r=16)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alternativeMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IA3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reasoning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'QLoRA 降低硬件门槛，IA3 参数更少'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scenario: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'多任务/多租户'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    primaryMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LoRA + 适配器切换'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alternativeMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Prefix Tuning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reasoning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每个任务独立的小适配器，切换成本低'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scenario: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'快速原型验证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    primaryMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Prompt Tuning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alternativeMethod: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IA3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reasoning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'训练最快，参数最少，适合验证思路'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PEFT 方法家族包含适配器、提示和低秩三大类，各有不同的参数-效果权衡</li>\n<li>Adapter Tuning 通过瓶颈网络注入适配层，参数量 1-5%，灵活但增加推理延迟</li>\n<li>Prefix Tuning 在每层添加虚拟前缀，Prompt Tuning 仅在输入层添加，后者在大模型上效果显著</li>\n<li>IA3 和 BitFit 是参数量最少的方法，适合快速原型验证和极端资源受限场景</li>\n<li>实践中 LoRA/QLoRA 是最通用的选择，其他方法适合特定约束下的替代方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"其他参数高效方法","id":"其他参数高效方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Adapter Tuning","id":"adapter-tuning"},{"level":2,"text":"Prefix Tuning 与 Prompt Tuning","id":"prefix-tuning-与-prompt-tuning"},{"level":2,"text":"IA3 与 BitFit","id":"ia3-与-bitfit"},{"level":2,"text":"方法选择指南","id":"方法选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"QLoRA 量化微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/qlora"},"next":{"title":"Adapter 适配器方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/adapter-methods"}}